{
    "title": "Our Groceries Shopping List",
    "description": "Never forget your list at home, and always know the exact right items to get. Add milk to the grocery list and your partner sees it immediately\u2014even if they\u2019re already shopping at the store!\r\n\r\n\"I love technology, but I also love simplicity. I've found the best of both in OurGroceries.\" \u2014The Kitchn (https://www.thekitchn.com/ourgroceries-a-grocery-list-app-that-simply-works-165395)\r\n\r\nEveryone in your household can share the same grocery list, and they can add items whether they\u2019re at home, at work, or on the go, using OurGroceries with their smartphone, tablet, laptop, or even Alexa.\r\n\r\nAt the grocery store, the OurGroceries app makes your shopping easy, efficient, and stress free. An organized list lets you visit only the aisles needed for each trip, and adding photos makes sure the right items always come home\u2014regardless of who\u2019s doing the shopping.\r\n\r\nDownload the OurGroceries app and simplify your grocery shopping today!\r\n\r\nAll features are available in the free ad-supported version, and with a single low-cost upgrade your whole family goes ad-free.\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n\u2022 Share the same grocery list with all family members. \r\n\u2022 Make sure your partner gets exactly the right brand or size by adding a photo or note to any grocery list item.\r\n\u2022 Every change to your shared shopping list is visible in seconds. See items being checked off as your partner shops!\r\n\u2022 Make shopping faster and easier by organizing your shopping list by category or aisle.\r\n\u2022 Organize your grocery items automatically using the built-in category suggestions, including region-specific suggestions for Canada, UK, Ireland, Australia, New Zealand (NZ), South Africa (SA), and more.\r\n\u2022 Browse your favorite meal ideas anytime by cataloging your recipes in OurGroceries.\r\n\u2022 Add a recipe\u2019s ingredients to your shopping list with one tap.\r\n\u2022 Available for Android, iPhone, and iPad, and can be used from any laptop.\r\n\u2022 Use Alexa, Siri, or Google Assistant to add items with voice commands.\r\n\u2022 Use your Apple Watch or Wear OS watch for convenient hands-free shopping.\r\n\u2022 Create as many separate shopping lists as you wish, or keep it simple and use just one.\r\n\u2022 All your items, lists, and recipes are automatically backed up by OurGroceries. Upgrade, replace, or restore your phone without worrying about losing your data.\r\n\u2022 You can scan a barcode to add an item to your grocery list.\r\n\u2022 Also great for non-grocery lists like errands, reminders, movies, and gifts!\r\n\r\nVisit https://www.ourgroceries.com for more information.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Never forget your list at home, and always know the exact right items to get. Add milk to the grocery list and your partner sees it immediately\u2014even if they\u2019re already shopping at the store!<br><br>&quot;I love technology, but I also love simplicity. I&#39;ve found the best of both in OurGroceries.&quot; \u2014The Kitchn (https://www.thekitchn.com/ourgroceries-a-grocery-list-app-that-simply-works-165395)<br><br>Everyone in your household can share the same grocery list, and they can add items whether they\u2019re at home, at work, or on the go, using OurGroceries with their smartphone, tablet, laptop, or even Alexa.<br><br>At the grocery store, the OurGroceries app makes your shopping easy, efficient, and stress free. An organized list lets you visit only the aisles needed for each trip, and adding photos makes sure the right items always come home\u2014regardless of who\u2019s doing the shopping.<br><br>Download the OurGroceries app and simplify your grocery shopping today!<br><br>All features are available in the free ad-supported version, and with a single low-cost upgrade your whole family goes ad-free.<br><br>FEATURES:<br>\u2022 Share the same grocery list with all family members. <br>\u2022 Make sure your partner gets exactly the right brand or size by adding a photo or note to any grocery list item.<br>\u2022 Every change to your shared shopping list is visible in seconds. See items being checked off as your partner shops!<br>\u2022 Make shopping faster and easier by organizing your shopping list by category or aisle.<br>\u2022 Organize your grocery items automatically using the built-in category suggestions, including region-specific suggestions for Canada, UK, Ireland, Australia, New Zealand (NZ), South Africa (SA), and more.<br>\u2022 Browse your favorite meal ideas anytime by cataloging your recipes in OurGroceries.<br>\u2022 Add a recipe\u2019s ingredients to your shopping list with one tap.<br>\u2022 Available for Android, iPhone, and iPad, and can be used from any laptop.<br>\u2022 Use Alexa, Siri, or Google Assistant to add items with voice commands.<br>\u2022 Use your Apple Watch or Wear OS watch for convenient hands-free shopping.<br>\u2022 Create as many separate shopping lists as you wish, or keep it simple and use just one.<br>\u2022 All your items, lists, and recipes are automatically backed up by OurGroceries. Upgrade, replace, or restore your phone without worrying about losing your data.<br>\u2022 You can scan a barcode to add an item to your grocery list.<br>\u2022 Also great for non-grocery lists like errands, reminders, movies, and gifts!<br><br>Visit https://www.ourgroceries.com for more information.",
